<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>東京・富士 秋日行 2026.10.02–10.09</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@500;700;900&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" crossorigin="" />
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#1F2A3D;
    --ink-soft:#5B6478;
    --paper:#F7F2E7;
    --paper-2:#EFE6D2;
    --card:#FFFDF8;
    --accent:#C1440E;
    --accent-2:#B5892B;
    --line:#E3D7B8;
    --green:#5B7553;
    --blue:#2A5CAA;
    --shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(31,42,61,0.12);
    --safe-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:"Noto Sans TC","PingFang TC","Microsoft JhengHei",sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    padding-bottom:calc(68px + var(--safe-bottom));
    min-height:100vh;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,.serif{ font-family:"Noto Serif TC",serif; }
  ::selection{ background:#E9C9A8; }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    background:
      radial-gradient(130% 160% at 12% -10%, #33456A 0%, #1F2A3D 50%, #121B29 100%);
    color:#F4EFE2;
    padding:26px 20px 24px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; right:-60px; top:-60px;
    width:220px; height:220px; border-radius:50%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(193,68,14,0.55) 0%, rgba(193,68,14,0) 70%);
  }
  .hero::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; left:-30px; bottom:-70px;
    width:160px; height:160px; border-radius:50%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(181,137,43,0.35) 0%, rgba(181,137,43,0) 70%);
  }
  .hero .eyebrow{
    font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.14em; color:#D9BE8C; margin:0 0 8px;
    position:relative; z-index:1; font-weight:700;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:27px; line-height:1.3; margin:0 0 10px; font-weight:900;
    position:relative; z-index:1;
  }
  .hero p.dates{
    margin:0; font-size:13.5px; color:#C9CFDD; position:relative; z-index:1;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  }
  .hero p.dates::before{ content:"◆"; color:var(--accent); font-size:9px; }

  /* ---------- BOTTOM NAV ---------- */
  .bottom-nav{
    position:fixed; left:0; right:0; bottom:0; z-index:50;
    display:flex; background:rgba(255,253,248,0.96);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding-bottom:var(--safe-bottom);
    box-shadow:0 -8px 22px rgba(31,42,61,0.10);
  }
  .bottom-nav button{
    flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:3px;
    background:none; border:none; padding:10px 4px 9px; font-family:inherit;
    color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:11.5px; cursor:pointer; position:relative;
  }
  .bottom-nav button .ic{ font-size:21px; line-height:1; }
  .bottom-nav button.active{ color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; }
  .bottom-nav button.active::before{
    content:""; position:absolute; top:0; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);
    width:26px; height:3px; border-radius:0 0 4px 4px; background:var(--accent);
  }

  /* ---------- VIEWS ---------- */
  .view{ display:none; }
  .view.active{ display:block; animation:fadeIn .25s ease; }
  @keyframes fadeIn{ from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(4px);} to{opacity:1; transform:none;} }

  /* ---------- MAP ---------- */
  .map-wrap{ position:relative; }
  #overview-map{ width:100%; height:36vh; min-height:220px; background:#e7e0cd; }
  .leaflet-container{ font-family:inherit; }

  .day-pills{
    display:flex; gap:8px; overflow-x:auto; padding:12px 14px 11px;
    background:var(--paper-2);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;
    scrollbar-width:none;
  }
  .day-pills::-webkit-scrollbar{ display:none; }
  .day-pill{
    flex:0 0 auto; padding:8px 15px; border-radius:999px;
    background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:13px; color:var(--ink-soft); white-space:nowrap; cursor:pointer;
    font-weight:600; transition:all .15s ease;
  }
  .day-pill .wk{ opacity:.6; margin-left:3px; font-size:11px;}
  .day-pill.active{
    background:var(--accent); border-color:var(--accent); color:#fff;
    box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(193,68,14,0.35);
  }

  /* ---------- DAY CONTENT ---------- */
  .day-panel{ display:none; padding:18px 16px 8px; }
  .day-panel.active{ display:block; }

  .day-head{
    display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:10px; margin-bottom:3px;
  }
  .day-head .num{ font-size:23px; font-weight:900; }
  .day-head .wk{ color:var(--accent-2); font-size:13px; font-weight:700; }
  .day-title{ color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:13.5px; margin:0 0 14px; }

  .hotel-banner{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#EFE6D2,#F3ECDC); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:14px;
    padding:11px 13px; margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .hotel-banner .ic{ font-size:20px; }
  .hotel-banner .txt{ flex:1; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:500; }
  .hotel-banner a{ color:var(--accent); text-decoration:none; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; white-space:nowrap; }

  .timeline{ position:relative; padding-left:2px; }
  .item{
    position:relative;
    display:flex; gap:12px;
    padding:0 0 20px 0;
  }
  .item::before{
    content:""; position:absolute; left:16px; top:34px; bottom:-2px; width:1px;
    background:var(--line);
  }
  .item:last-child::before{ display:none; }
  .item .badge{
    flex:0 0 33px; height:33px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px;
    z-index:1; box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(31,42,61,0.06);
  }
  .item .body{ flex:1; padding-top:2px; }
  .item .time{ font-size:11.5px; color:var(--accent-2); font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.02em; }
  .item .name{ font-size:15.5px; font-weight:700; margin:2px 0 3px; }
  .item .note{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:0 0 7px; line-height:1.55; }
  .item .note.warn{ color:var(--accent); font-weight:600; }
  .item .links{ display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .item .links a{
    font-size:12px; text-decoration:none; color:var(--ink);
    background:var(--paper-2); border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:5px 10px; border-radius:999px; font-weight:600;
  }
  .item .links a.map-link{ color:var(--blue); border-color:#cfd9ec; background:#EEF2FA; }
  .item .links a.off-link{ color:var(--green); border-color:#d8e0d3; background:#EFF3EC; }

  .candidate-card{
    margin:6px 16px 22px; background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:16px; padding:15px; box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  }
  .candidate-card h3{ margin:0 0 4px; font-size:15px; }
  .candidate-card p.hint{ font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:0 0 10px; }
  .candidate-list{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; }
  .candidate-list a{
    font-size:12.5px; text-decoration:none; color:var(--ink);
    background:var(--paper-2); border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:7px 12px; border-radius:999px; font-weight:600;
  }

  /* ---------- CONVERT ---------- */
  #view-convert .inner{ padding:18px 16px 24px; }
  .section-title{ margin:0 0 4px; font-size:20px; }
  .section-sub{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:0 0 16px; }
  .conv-card{
    background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:18px;
    padding:18px; box-shadow:var(--shadow); margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .conv-card h3{ font-size:14.5px; margin:0 0 14px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }
  .conv-row{ margin-bottom:14px; }
  .conv-row label{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); display:block; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .conv-input-wrap{ display:flex; align-items:stretch; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; background:var(--paper); }
  .conv-input-wrap span{ padding:0 12px; font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-soft); background:var(--paper-2); display:flex; align-items:center; font-weight:700; }
  .conv-input-wrap input{
    flex:1; border:none; padding:13px 12px; font-size:19px; font-family:inherit;
    background:transparent; color:var(--ink); font-weight:700; min-width:0;
  }
  .conv-input-wrap input:focus{ outline:none; }
  .conv-swap{ text-align:center; color:var(--accent-2); font-size:13px; margin:2px 0 12px; }

  .rate-row{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:10px;}
  .rate-row input{ width:100px; padding:7px 8px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid var(--line); font-family:inherit; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; }
  .rate-source{ font-size:11.5px; }
  .rate-source a{ color:var(--blue); }

  .toggle-row{ display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .toggle-row .lbl{ font-size:13.5px; font-weight:500; }
  .toggle-row .lbl small{ display:block; font-size:11px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-weight:400; margin-top:2px; }
  .switch{ position:relative; width:44px; height:26px; flex:0 0 44px; }
  .switch input{ opacity:0; width:0; height:0; }
  .switch .slider{ position:absolute; inset:0; background:#DCD3BC; border-radius:999px; transition:.2s; cursor:pointer; }
  .switch .slider::before{ content:""; position:absolute; width:20px; height:20px; left:3px; top:3px; background:#fff; border-radius:50%; transition:.2s; box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.25); }
  .switch input:checked + .slider{ background:var(--accent); }
  .switch input:checked + .slider::before{ transform:translateX(18px); }

  .pct-row{ display:flex; gap:10px; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .pct-field{ flex:1; }
  .pct-field label{ font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-soft); display:block; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .pct-input-wrap{ display:flex; align-items:center; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; background:var(--paper); }
  .pct-input-wrap input{ flex:1; border:none; padding:11px 10px; font-size:15px; font-family:inherit; background:transparent; color:var(--ink); font-weight:700; min-width:0; }
  .pct-input-wrap input:focus{ outline:none; }
  .pct-input-wrap span{ padding:0 10px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:13px; }
  .pct-presets{ display:flex; gap:6px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:8px 0 4px; }
  .pct-presets button{
    border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--paper-2); color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-size:12px; padding:5px 10px; border-radius:999px; font-family:inherit; cursor:pointer; font-weight:600;
  }
  .pct-presets button.active{ background:var(--accent); border-color:var(--accent); color:#fff; }

  .result-box{
    margin-top:6px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F3ECDC,#EFE6D2); border-radius:14px; padding:14px 15px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .result-box .row{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); padding:3px 0; }
  .result-box .row.final{ font-size:16px; font-weight:800; color:var(--ink); border-top:1px dashed #D8CBA6; margin-top:6px; padding-top:9px; }
  .conv-note{ font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.6; }

  /* ---------- PHRASEBOOK ---------- */
  #view-phrase .inner{ padding:18px 16px 24px; }
  .phrase-tabs{ display:flex; gap:8px; overflow-x:auto; margin-bottom:14px; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; scrollbar-width:none;}
  .phrase-tabs::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}
  .phrase-tab{
    flex:0 0 auto; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--card); color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:13px; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer;
  }
  .phrase-tab.active{ background:var(--ink); border-color:var(--ink); color:#F4EFE2; }
  .phrase-card{
    background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:16px;
    padding:14px 15px; margin-bottom:10px; box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;
  }
  .phrase-card .txt{ flex:1; }
  .phrase-card .ja{ font-size:17px; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 3px; }
  .phrase-card .kana{ font-size:12px; color:var(--accent-2); margin:0 0 3px; }
  .phrase-card .zh{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:0; }
  .speak-btn{
    flex:0 0 46px; height:46px; border-radius:50%; border:none;
    background:var(--accent); color:#fff; font-size:19px; cursor:pointer;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(193,68,14,0.35);
  }
  .speak-btn.playing{ background:var(--accent-2); }
  .phrase-note{ font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:6px; line-height:1.6; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">JAPAN TRIP</p>
  <h1>東京・富士五湖<br>秋日行</h1>
  <p class="dates">2026.10.02（五）— 10.09（五）・8天7夜</p>
</header>

<!-- ===================== 行程 VIEW ===================== -->
<section id="view-itinerary" class="view active">
  <div class="map-wrap">
    <div id="overview-map"></div>
    <div class="day-pills" id="day-pills"></div>
  </div>
  <div id="day-panels"></div>
  <div class="candidate-card">
    <h3>🍽️ 候補餐廳（尚未排入特定日期）</h3>
    <p class="hint">以下幾間先列著，之後再依行程機動安排是哪一天吃：</p>
    <div class="candidate-list" id="candidate-list"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===================== 換算 VIEW ===================== -->
<section id="view-convert" class="view">
  <div class="inner">
    <h2 class="serif section-title">日圓／台幣 換算</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">含刷卡手續費、退稅、優惠券折扣的購物實付估算</p>

    <div class="conv-card">
      <h3>🛍️ 購物實付估算</h3>
      <div class="conv-row">
        <label>商品標價（日圓）</label>
        <div class="conv-input-wrap">
          <span>¥</span>
          <input type="number" id="shop-jpy" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pct-row">
        <div class="pct-field">
          <label>優惠券折扣</label>
          <div class="pct-input-wrap"><input type="number" id="discount-pct" value="0" min="0" max="100" step="1"><span>%</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pct-field">
          <label>退稅</label>
          <div class="pct-input-wrap"><input type="number" id="taxrefund-pct" value="0" min="0" max="100" step="0.5"><span>%</span></div>
          <div class="pct-presets" id="refund-presets"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="toggle-row">
        <div class="lbl">海外刷卡手續費<small>預設 1.5%，未勾選則不計入</small></div>
        <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="fee-toggle"><span class="slider"></span></label>
      </div>

      <div class="rate-row">
        匯率：1 JPY = <input type="number" id="rate-input" step="0.00000001" value="0.20479725"> TWD
      </div>
      <p class="rate-source">資料來源：<a href="https://www.twrates.com/card/visa/jpy.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">twrates.com（VISA 日圓/台幣，2026-09-08）</a>，可自行更改為出發前查到的最新匯率</p>

      <div class="result-box">
        <div class="row"><span>折扣後金額</span><span id="r-after-discount">¥0</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span>退稅後實付（日圓）</span><span id="r-after-refund">¥0</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span>刷卡手續費</span><span id="r-fee">＋NT$0</span></div>
        <div class="row final"><span>台幣實付金額</span><span id="r-final">NT$0</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="conv-card">
      <h3>💱 快速雙向換算</h3>
      <div class="conv-row">
        <label>日圓 JPY</label>
        <div class="conv-input-wrap"><span>¥</span><input type="number" id="jpy-input" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="conv-swap">↕ 使用上方同一組匯率</div>
      <div class="conv-row">
        <label>台幣 TWD</label>
        <div class="conv-input-wrap"><span>NT$</span><input type="number" id="twd-input" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="0"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="conv-note">匯率每日變動，出發前建議至 twrates.com 或銀行 App 再次確認當日匯率；此頁計算結果僅供旅途中概略估算參考。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===================== 日文 VIEW ===================== -->
<section id="view-phrase" class="view">
  <div class="inner">
    <h2 class="serif section-title">日文萬用句</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">按 🔊 按鈕就會唸出日文發音</p>
    <div class="phrase-tabs" id="phrase-tabs"></div>
    <div id="phrase-list"></div>
    <p class="phrase-note">發音使用手機瀏覽器內建的語音合成功能，效果會依裝置與是否安裝日文語音包而不同；若沒有聲音，可到手機設定安裝日文語音。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="bottom-nav">
  <button class="nav-btn active" data-view="itinerary"><span class="ic">🗺️</span>行程</button>
  <button class="nav-btn" data-view="convert"><span class="ic">💴</span>換算</button>
  <button class="nav-btn" data-view="phrase"><span class="ic">🗣️</span>日文</button>
</nav>

<script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js" crossorigin=""></script>
